nique events and locations.<br><br> <strong>\u0421urrent development roadmap looks like this:</strong><br><strong>2023</strong> \u2013 Development begins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2025</strong> \u2013 Steam page goes live</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Late 2025 / Early 2026</strong> \u2013 Alpha demo release</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2026</strong> \u2013 Early Access launch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2026\u20132028</strong> \u2013 Ongoing Early Access support before full release<br><strong>2028</strong> \u2013 Full game release*<br><br>*Dates and milestones are subject to change as development progresses.</p>","developers":["mikburlak"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793270/517778c22415712cc693b86deb5118316a71b058/header.jpg?t=1757788058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183950,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183950/movie480.mp4?t=1755298742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183950/movie_max.mp4?t=1755298742"},"name":"Bygoner- UGF 2025 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183950/71a54d6abaab13c53900cff0733d22bbf389c15b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755298742","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183950/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755298742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183950/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755298742"}}],"name":"Bygoner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong